    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x">
            <div class="small-12 medium-8 large-8 cell">
                <h1>Training</h1>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{% include "@components/navigation-prototypes/navbar-tooth.twig" %}

<section class="grid-container">
    <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x">
        <div class="cell large-8 medium-8 small-12">
            <p>Teachers participating in the study are randomly assigned to one of three training options—an in-person session, a conference call or a self-paced program—in order to compare which method best supports oral health education. </p>
            <p>Participants randomized to the in-person training group will receive on-site sessions, with the study team traveling to their location to deliver the training.</p>
            <p>A $300 honorarium is offered to participating teachers.</p>
            <h2 class="h3">In-person sessions</h2>
            <p>
                <ul>
                    <li>90-minute training lecture</li>
                    <li>Curriculum and tool kit</li>
                    <li>Follow-up surveys (online 7days, 3, 6 and 12 months)</li>
                    <li>Brief review seminar via Zoom (3, 6 and 12 months)</li>
                    <li>Training of the teachers occurs after school hours*</li>
                </ul>
            </p>

            <h2 class="h3">Conference call platforms (Zoom)</h2>
            <p>
                <ul>
                    <li>90-minute training lecture (via Zoom)</li>
                    <li>Curriculum and tool kit</li>
                    <li>Follow-up surveys (online 7days, 3, 6 and 12 months)</li>
                    <li>Brief review seminar via Zoom (3, 6 and 12 months)</li>
                    <li>Training of the teachers occurs after school hours*</li>
                </ul>
            </p>

            <h2 class="h3">Self-taught (online, at your own pace)</h2>
            <p>
                <ul>
                    <li>90-minute recorded training lecture</li>
                    <li>Curriculum and tool kit</li>
                    <li>Follow-up surveys (online 7days, 3, 6 and 12 months)</li>
                    <li>Brief review seminar via Zoom (3, 6 and 12 months)</li>
                    <li>Training of the teachers occurs after school hours*</li>
                </ul>
            </p>
            <p><em>*Scheduling to be discussed with individual schools/teachers participating</em></p>

            <h2 class="h3">Oral care supplies and educational materials</h2>
            <p>All teachers and their students will receive toothpaste, toothbrush and dental floss.</p>
            <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x">
                <div class="cell large-3 medium-3 small-12">
                    <img src="../../images/tooth-materials-1.png">
                </div>
                 <div class="cell large-3 medium-3 small-12">
                    <img src="../../images/tooth-materials-3.png">
                </div>
                <div class="cell large-3 medium-3 small-12">
                    <img src="../../images/tooth-materials-2.png">
                </div>
               
                <div class="cell large-3 medium-3 small-12">
                    <img src="../../images/tooth-materials-4.png">
                </div>
            </div>
            
            
        </div>
        <div class="cell large-4 medium-4 small-12">
            <p>This study is for <strong>elementary teachers</strong>. If you are interested in learning more about the study or participating, please complete the Contact Us form.</p>
            <a class="callout color orange flex-child-auto">
                <span class="fa-stack fa-2x">
                    <i class="fas fa-circle fa-stack-2x"></i>
                    <i class="fas fa-envelope fa-stack-1x fa-inverse"></i>
                </span>
                <h3>Contact Us</h3>
            </a>
        </div>
        

    </div>
</section>





